@startuml Kelola_Produk
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram: Kelola Produk (Manage Products) - Admin
actor Admin
participant "Mobile App\n(Flutter)" as App
participant "Backend\nAPI" as API
database "Database" as DB

Admin -> App: Login sebagai Admin
App -> App: Set Admin Session
App --> Admin: Tampilkan Admin Dashboard

Admin -> App: Klik Menu Kelola Produk
App -> API: GET /api/admin/products
API -> DB: Query All Products
DB --> API: Return Product List
API --> App: Response JSON (Product List)
App --> Admin: Tampilkan Daftar Produk\n(ID, Nama, Harga, Stok, Status)

alt Tambah Produk Baru
    Admin -> App: Klik Tombol Tambah Produk
    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Form Tambah Produk

    Admin -> App: Input Nama, Deskripsi, Harga, Stok, Kategori, Gambar
    App -> App: Validasi Input (Required Fields)

    alt Input Valid
        App -> API: POST /api/admin/products
        note right of App
            Request Body:
            - name
            - description
            - price
            - stock
            - category
            - image
            - admin_id
        end note

        API -> DB: Create New Product
        DB --> API: Success (Product ID Generated)
        API --> App: Response 201 (Product Created)
        App --> Admin: Tampilkan Success Toast\n"Produk berhasil ditambahkan"
        App -> API: GET /api/admin/products
        API -> DB: Query Updated Product List
        DB --> API: Return Product List
        API --> App: Response Updated List
        App --> Admin: Refresh Daftar Produk
    else Input Invalid
        App --> Admin: Tampilkan Error "Lengkapi semua field"
    end

else Edit Produk
    Admin -> App: Klik Salah Satu Produk untuk Edit
    App -> API: GET /api/admin/products/{product_id}
    API -> DB: Query Product Detail
    DB --> API: Return Product Data
    API --> App: Response Product Detail
    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Form Edit dengan Data Existing

    Admin -> App: Update Fields (Nama, Harga, Stok, dll)
    App -> App: Validasi Input

    alt Input Valid
        App -> API: PUT /api/admin/products/{product_id}
        note right of App
            Request Body:
            - name
            - description
            - price
            - stock
            - category
            - image
        end note

        API -> DB: Update Product Record
        DB --> API: Success
        API --> App: Response 200 (Product Updated)
        App --> Admin: Tampilkan Success "Produk berhasil diubah"
    else Input Invalid
        App --> Admin: Tampilkan Error "Data tidak valid"
    end

else Hapus Produk
    Admin -> App: Klik Tombol Delete pada Produk
    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Confirmation Dialog

    Admin -> App: Confirm Delete
    App -> API: DELETE /api/admin/products/{product_id}

    API -> DB: Check if Product has Active Orders
    alt No Active Orders
        API -> DB: Delete Product Record
        DB --> API: Success
        API --> App: Response 200
        App --> Admin: Tampilkan Success "Produk berhasil dihapus"
        App -> API: GET /api/admin/products
        API -> DB: Query Updated List
        DB --> API: Return Product List
        API --> App: Response Updated List
        App --> Admin: Refresh Daftar Produk
    else Active Orders Exist
        API --> App: Response 409 (Cannot delete)
        App --> Admin: Tampilkan Error "Produk tidak dapat dihapus\n(masih ada pesanan aktif)"
    end
end

@enduml
